{"text": "Luego quiso sentarse. La silla grande era muy alta y la mediana demasiado ancha. La pequeña le pareció cómoda, pero Ricitos comenzó a balancearse. Una pata se soltó y la niña acabó sentada en el suelo. Ricitos: No debí balancearme en una silla ajena.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.507833, "from": 0, "to": 5}, {"start": 0.522583, "end": 0.891791, "from": 6, "to": 11}, {"start": 0.906583, "end": 1.644999, "from": 12, "to": 20}, {"start": 2.673083, "end": 2.879833, "from": 22, "to": 24}, {"start": 2.894625, "end": 3.278625, "from": 25, "to": 30}, {"start": 3.293375, "end": 3.765958, "from": 31, "to": 37}, {"start": 3.780708, "end": 3.972708, "from": 38, "to": 41}, {"start": 3.987458, "end": 4.297583, "from": 42, "to": 45}, {"start": 4.312375, "end": 4.6225, "from": 46, "to": 50}, {"start": 4.637291, "end": 4.696374, "from": 51, "to": 52}, {"start": 4.711125, "end": 4.829291, "from": 53, "to": 55}, {"start": 4.844041, "end": 5.301874, "from": 56, "to": 63}, {"start": 5.316625, "end": 5.981208, "from": 64, "to": 73}, {"start": 5.996, "end": 6.468583, "from": 74, "to": 79}, {"start": 7.487583, "end": 7.694333, "from": 81, "to": 83}, {"start": 7.709125, "end": 8.1965, "from": 84, "to": 91}, {"start": 8.21125, "end": 8.344166, "from": 92, "to": 94}, {"start": 8.358916, "end": 8.861041, "from": 95, "to": 102}, {"start": 8.875833, "end": 9.392708, "from": 103, "to": 109}, {"start": 9.732375, "end": 9.968666, "from": 111, "to": 115}, {"start": 9.983458, "end": 10.588958, "from": 116, "to": 123}, {"start": 10.60375, "end": 11.135416, "from": 124, "to": 131}, {"start": 11.150166, "end": 11.179707, "from": 132, "to": 133}, {"start": 11.194458, "end": 12.080583, "from": 134, "to": 145}, {"start": 13.099583, "end": 13.350666, "from": 147, "to": 150}, {"start": 13.365416, "end": 13.705082, "from": 151, "to": 155}, {"start": 13.719875, "end": 13.867541, "from": 156, "to": 158}, {"start": 13.882333, "end": 14.354916, "from": 159, "to": 164}, {"start": 14.369666, "e